or  $\frac{(\sqrt{x}-\sqrt{1006}) - (\sqrt{2012-x}-\sqrt{1006})}{x-1006} = \frac{2(\sqrt{x}-\sqrt{2012-x})}{2(x-1006)}$ ;

or  $\sqrt{x} - \sqrt{1006} - \sqrt{2012-x} + \sqrt{1006} = \sqrt{x} - \sqrt{2012-x}$ ;

or  $\sqrt{x} - \sqrt{2012-x} = \sqrt{x} - \sqrt{2012-x}$ .

