&=\left(\sqrt[3]{abc}+\frac{1}{\sqrt[3]{abc}}+1\right)\left((\sqrt[6]{abc})^2+1+\frac{1}{(\sqrt[6]{abc})^2}\right)^2
&= \left(\sqrt[3]{abc}+\frac{1}{\sqrt[3]{abc}}+1\right)^3.
\end{align*}
But the last inequality follows by generalized Holder, so we are done.

Let,   $$ x = a + \frac1b , y = b + \frac1c , z = c + \frac1a , t = \sqrt[3]{abc} $$  Observe that   $$ xyz - (x+y+z) = t^3 - 3t $$  Hence, 
\begin{align*}
& \qquad ~~~ \frac{1}{x + 1} + \frac{1}{y+1} + \frac{1}{z+1} \ge \frac{3}{t+1} 
& \iff \frac{(xy + yz + zx) + 2(x+y+z) + 3}{(x+1)(y+1)(z+1)} \ge \frac{3}{t+1} 
&\iff 1 + \frac{xyz - (x+y+z) + 2}{(x+1)(y+1)(z+1)} \ge \frac{3}{t+1} 
&\iff \frac{t^3 - 3t + 2}{(x+1)(y+1)(z+1)} \ge \frac{-t + 2}{t+1} 
&\iff \frac{(2-t)(t+1)^2}{(x+1)(y+1)(z+1)} \ge \frac{2-t}{t+1} 
&\iff (t-2)(x+1)(y+1)(z+1) \ge (t-2)(t+1)^3
\end{align*} 
