We start by constructing  $N+1$   $n$ -beautiful labelings. Set the circumference of the circle to 1 and let  $\alpha$  be an irrational number. Place point  $k$  a distance  $k\alpha$  counterclockwise around the circle from 0. Then all the  $s$ -chords (for each  $s$ ) are parallel, so they do not meet, and we obtain a beautiful labeling.

