dot(" $0$ ",dir(290),S);
[/asy]</details>.
In either case, we see that if we add the chord  $\{0,n\}$ , then the set of chords of the form  $a+b=n$  is self-parallel.</details>
[hide=Case 2 - The strip is a "middle strip"]
The picture for this is <details><summary>Figure 5</summary>[asy]
