- the terms  $a_{a_2 + 1}$ ,  $a_{a_2 + 2}$ ,  $\dots$ ,  $a_{a_3}$  must be equal to  $n + 2$
- $\dots$
- the terms  $a_{a_{k - 1} + 1}$ ,  $a_{a_{k - 1} + 2}$ ,  $\dots$ ,  $a_{a_k}$  must be equal to  $n + k - 1$
- the terms  $a_{a_k + 1}$ ,  $a_{a_k + 2}$ ,  $\dots$ ,  $a_n$  must be equal to  $n + k$


