Observe that  $\overline{AB}$  is tangent to  $(BDR)$  and thus  $RDQC$  is cyclic by PoP. Also,  $\overline{PD}$  is tangent to  $(ADC)$  by PoP.

Note that
\begin{align*}
\measuredangle DPQ= \measuredangle BPC +\measuredangle DPB=4\measuredangle ACB+\measuredangle BCA+\measuredangle PBC=2\measuredangle ACB +\measuredangle ABC.
