	[AST] &= [AA_1T] 
	&= \frac{AM^2 \sin \beta \sin \gamma}{2 \sin \left( \beta + \gamma \right)} 
	&= 7^2 \cdot 288 \cdot \frac{\frac{5}{13} \cdot \frac{3}{5}}{\frac{5}{13} \cdot \frac{4}{5} + \frac{12}{13} \cdot \frac{3}{5}} 
	&= 7^2 \cdot 288 \cdot \frac{15}{56} 
	&= 3780.
\end{align*} In that case, the desired quantity is  $[ABC]-[AST] = 84 \cdot 7^2 - 3780 = \boxed{336}$ .</details>
